<title>PORTUGAL: Cimpor privatisation stock starts trade.</title>
<headline>Cimpor privatisation stock starts trade.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Part of the stock sold at the privatisation of cement group Cimpor-Cimentos de Portugal was admitted to trade at 1138 GMT, the Lisbon bourse said.</p>
<p>The shares are the 21.4 million sold at the public offer to sell and through direct sale to domestic investors. Shares sold through the foreign private placement will begin trading on Friday.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
